# Node: atomic.ByBuiltinRule — inequality symmetry
# Run: litex -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_builtin_rule/not_equal_symmetry.lit
#
# When: known `a != b` for sets; goal `b != a`.
# After: builtin not-equal symmetry proves the flipped inequality.

forall a set, b set:
    $is_set(a)
    $is_set(b)
    a != b
    =>:
        b != a
